# Votal device agent: rollout kit for fleet "{{fleet}}" ({{mdm}})

This kit puts the Votal device agent on your employees' laptops. The agent
checks prompts to AI tools on the laptop, before they leave it, against your
company's DLP policy. Every value is already filled in: you upload files and
scope them to a group. Nothing is typed by hand.

